**CRITICAL RULE: DO NOT RUN THE APPLICATION SERVER**

The Next.js development server is always running on `http://localhost:3000`. 

- Never attempt to start the server with `npm run dev`, `yarn dev`, or similar commands
- Never run `next dev` or any server startup commands
- The server is already running and available at localhost:3000
- If you need to test endpoints or functionality, use the running server at http://localhost:3000
- Only make code changes and let the user handle server management
